Parent `.about` add `position: relative;` create positioning context. 

In [`About.css`](file:///home/gaitano/01-studio/01-src/eugene-gaitano/frontend/src/components/About/About.css#L1-L11):

```css
.about {
  position: relative;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 64px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}

.about img {
  position: absolute;
  top: 0;
  left: 0; /* or right / bottom / transform */
  height: 360px;
}
```

Add coordinates (`top`, `bottom`, `left`, `right`) to place image where needed.

`.about img` add `transform: rotate(...)` change angle.

In [`About.css`](file:///home/gaitano/01-studio/01-src/eugene-gaitano/frontend/src/components/About/About.css#L7-L11):

```css
.about img {
  position: absolute;
  top: 0;
  height: 360px;
  transform: rotate(45deg); /* or -90deg, 180deg */
  transform-origin: center; /* optional: set pivot point */
}
```

Adjust degree value for desired angle.
